  "description": "First introduced in 1988, the Mongoose Switchback has been a staple of the Mongoose hardtail mountain bike assortment for over 30 years. The entry-level option in our Switchback series, the Switchback Trail is designed with everything a rider needs to take on single track trails or put in mile after mile on crushed gravel paths – all at an excellent value.\nLightweight aluminum alloy frame with SR Suntour XC-E28 suspension fork.\n21-speed Shimano shifters and derailleurs provide quick, precise gear changes.\nFront and rear mechanical disc brakes deliver crisp, all-condition stopping.\n27.5\" wheels with 2.1\"-wide tires on double-wall alloy rims provide durable all-terrain riding without weighing you down.\nThe Switchback Trail comes in sizes SM, MD, and LG. Suggested rider height of SM is 5’3” to 5’7”, MD is 5'7\" – 5’11”, LG is 5'11\" - 6'2\".",
